WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.405
Week 35: Analysis, Argument, and Professional Listening. identify main idea and supporting detail defend an opinion summarize unfamiliar material

2
00:00:10.405 --> 00:00:18.697
Mission brief. Listen to a multi-paragraph briefing, take notes, summarize it, and defend one recommendation under questioning.

3
00:00:18.697 --> 00:00:28.081
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:28.081 --> 00:00:35.776
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:35.776 --> 00:00:44.218
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:44.218 --> 00:01:15.191
Model language. Voy a escuchar una exposición de varios párrafos. — I am going to listen to a multi-paragraph briefing. Tomo notas mientras escucho. — I take notes while I listen. Resumo la exposición multipárrafo. — I summarize the multi-paragraph briefing. Defiendo una recomendación bajo cuestionamiento. — I defend a recommendation under questioning. Uso mis notas para responder con seguridad. — I use my notes to answer confidently.

7
00:01:15.191 --> 00:01:24.939
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
